{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764693,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"green_un","paid":0,"title":"Parivartan '26: Case Competition","festival_id":520833,"organization_id":1305,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-02T12:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-21T10:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/parivartan26-case-competition-tata-institute-of-social-sciences-tiss-mumbai-1764693","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong>Overview<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Parivartan '26 is the flagship event of the BSASS Outreach Cell at TISS Mumbai. The case competition under it consists of three levels to test the strategy and analytical skills of the participants. This event is held nationwide at an inter-college level that will pit students against each other in developing innovative and bold solutions in each round to prove their mettle. The event will be organized online over the course of 21st October - 31st October, 2026 and requires an on-campus presence for the final round to be conducted.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A team should consist of 1-3 people.<\/li>\n<li>This competition is open to all Bachelors and Masters University students.<\/li>\n<li>A student can be a part of only one team per competition.<\/li>\n<li>There is no restriction on the number of teams per institute.<\/li>\n<li>Any deviation from the above rules will result in immediate disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-college team members are allowed.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-specialization team members are allowed.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>All rounds are eliminating in nature.<\/li>\n<li>All decisions in eligibility, authenticity, and final judgments will be with the Organising Committee.<\/li>\n<li>The format and structure of events could be subject to change before the actual beginning of the event.<\/li>\n<li>The decisions of the organizers will be final and binding on all participants.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","ove